<text>
<p>Three months to March 31-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 196 vs 355</p>
<p> Loan and guarantee losses		  gain 34 vs 105 charge</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations	 558 vs 513</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish state-owned commercial bank is Postipankki Oy.</p>
